/*
  ============================================================
  CODE 3 MX7000 - ARDUINO GIGA DISPLAY CONTROLLER
  ============================================================

  Arduino GIGA R1 WiFi + GIGA Display Shield

  GIGA <-> Nano ESP32
  ----------------------------------------
  GIGA D1 TX  -> Nano D12 RX
  GIGA D0 RX  <- Nano D13 TX
  GIGA GND    -> Nano GND
  Baud: 38400

  ============================================================
  GAUGE SCREEN
  ============================================================

  Left:
    IPR
    0-100 %

  Right:
    ICP
    0-4000 PSI

  Theme:
    Black background
    OBS Ford-style green
    Red needles

  Header:
    7.3 POWER STROKE
    BLACK BETTY

  Hidden Lightbar Gesture:
    Put TWO fingers in the central gauge area.
    Move both generally DOWN approximately 50 pixels.

    No time limit.
    Fingers do not need to stay perfectly aligned.
    Diagonal movement is tolerated.

  ============================================================
  LIGHTBAR SCREEN
  ============================================================

  Equal-size 5 x 2 grid:

  ROW 1:
    TRAFFIC BREAKER
    INNERS
    INTERMEDIATES
    OUTERS
    LEDS

  ROW 2:
    CLOSE
    TA LEFT
    TA OUT
    TA RIGHT
    MONITOR

  CLOSE:
    Returns to Gauge screen.

  MONITOR:
    Opens Serial Monitor.

  ============================================================
  SERIAL MONITOR
  ============================================================

  NO hidden gesture.

  Opened only from MONITOR button.

  X button returns directly to Gauge screen.

  ============================================================
  GAUGE ALARM
  ============================================================

  Gauge flashing red border ONLY when:

    1. Simulation mode is active
       OR
    2. Real truck data times out.

  Nano/Mega communication failure does NOT cause
  the Gauge screen border to flash.

  Lightbar and Serial screens DO use Nano/Mega
  communication status for their red border.

  ============================================================
*/

